@JobTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5073

GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Job Applications CRUD

### List all job applications
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Accept: application/json

###

### List job applications filtered by status
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/?status=Interviewing
Accept: application/json

###

### Get job application by id
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a job application
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "roleTitle": "Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Applied",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": "Referred by a friend"
}

###

### Create a job application with an empty Company (expect 400)
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "",
  "roleTitle": "Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Applied",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": null
}

###

### Update a job application
PUT {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "roleTitle": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Interviewing",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": "Moved to interviewing"
}

###

### Delete a job application
DELETE {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1

###

# Interview Stages CRUD (nested under a job application)

### Create an interview stage under job application 1
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/interview-stages/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageName": "Phone Screen",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-09-22T15:00:00Z",
  "outcome": "Pending",
  "notes": null
}

###

### Update interview stage 1 under job application 1
PUT {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/interview-stages/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageName": "Phone Screen",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-09-22T15:00:00Z",
  "outcome": "Passed",
  "notes": "Went well"
}

###

### Delete interview stage 1 under job application 1
DELETE {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/interview-stages/1

###

### Mismatched parent: update job application 1's stage 1 using job application 2's id (expect 404)
PUT {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/2/interview-stages/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageName": "HIJACKED",
  "scheduledAt": null,
  "outcome": "Failed",
  "notes": "should not apply"
}

###

# Application Documents CRUD (nested under a job application)

### Create a document under job application 1
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/documents/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Cv",
  "label": "Resume v3",
  "notes": null
}

###

### Update document 1 under job application 1
PUT {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/documents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CoverLetter",
  "label": "Resume v4",
  "notes": "Updated"
}

###

### Delete document 1 under job application 1
DELETE {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1/documents/1

###
